<title>USA: West Marine February same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>West Marine February same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>WATSONVILLE, Calif. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Marine Inc Thursday reported sales for the four and eight weeks ended February 22.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$21.2	$14.1     +50.5	+10.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date     $38.3	$25.6     +49.4	 +9.7</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
